sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant I as Identity Service
    participant K as KMS
    participant P as Payment Processor
    participant B as Banking Connector

    C->>A: Payment request
    A->>I: Verify authorization
    I-->>A: Authorization result
    alt Unauthorized
        A-->>C: Reject
    else Authorized
        A->>K: Establish protected session
        K-->>A: Cryptographic context
        A->>P: Validated request
        P->>B: Authorized banking request
        B-->>P: Banking response
        P-->>A: Processing status
        A-->>C: Return status
    end
